    "body": "This method is defined by [CSSOM](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom/#dom-window-getcomputedstyle), not DOM, so I don't think this is the right repo for the issue. Looks like it has come up there previously, though: https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/379. (I don't know the history for why it's like this - FWIW I have mistyped it many times myself, forgetting its quirky placement).",
